{"title":"Gem Sapphire","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Captain</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-captain\" title=\"Dune Captain - Normal, 0.4% of recorded drops (1 / 236 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/164853a853a7615813df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Captain</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.4%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-sapphire\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>17</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=1\">1c <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=2\">2c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=3\">3c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=4\">4c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c can be made at the witch, so those count as common; bigger ones only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Sapphire found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Adept)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2220daf9c672592009e9.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>17 <span class=\"muted\">(63%)</span></td><td>60%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Adept: ≈0.75% more spell damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2220daf9c672592009e9.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(11%)</span></td><td>15%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c)</td><td>Adept: 2% more spell damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2220daf9c672592009e9.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(7.4%)</span></td><td>11%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c)</td><td>Adept: ≈2.25% more spell damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-sapphire?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/2220daf9c672592009e9.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-commo